  "scope": "The Compiler returns the Language-owned source_module test inventory from the same frontend result used to verify callable roots and emit application-build/6. A fresh process can locate a prior artifact candidate across root snapshots; changed source still runs the full frontend before executable-closure reuse. Exact fresh-process reuse preserves the inventory; edits refresh source spans or the affected test identity, and invalid input publishes neither inventory nor artifact. This does not implement Language verification-fact reuse or change the production mncs-test consumer."
